<section image-layout="blank" id="bFZKQOWbiR"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item vertical-align="center" colspan="34"><p role="eyebrow">B.Tech Node.js Laboratory · Illustrative teaching prototype</p><h1 font-size="46pt">One request in.<br/>One opaque <code>sid</code> out.</h1><h3 role="subheading">Trace a secure student login without exposing identity or storing plaintext passwords.</h3><spacer mode="fixed" size="14pt"></spacer><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item background-color="surface" padding="14pt 16pt" cell-decor="top-line"><p role="eyebrow">ACTIVE REQUEST TRACE</p><h4>Form → validation → rate limit → lookup → bcrypt → session regeneration → redirect</h4></grid-item></grid><p font-size="sm"><b>Success condition:</b> the browser receives only an opaque cookie. Every restricted route still performs authorization.</p></grid-item><grid-item background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.22" padding="26pt" colspan="26"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/KP4NfltcPpdph-SfvUf9W.png" saved-media-id="ondvowhgcazchf1" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="secure-stack-isometric" alt="Matte isometric secure student portal with one cyan request packet crossing a violet trust boundary toward a server and session vault" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><labels><label variant="outline">ONE REQUEST</label></labels><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item background-color="surface" padding="14pt 16pt"><labels><label variant="solid">ACTIVE REQUEST</label></labels><h3>POST /login</h3><p font-size="sm">email · password · _csrf</p><hr color="accent" thickness="md"/><p font-size="sm"><b>Expected response:</b> 303 + opaque <code>sid</code></p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>